  "problem": "Solve the inequality\n$\\frac{3x+4}{ln\\,({x}^{2}+1)+{e}^{x}}>\\frac{x+10}{ln\\,({x}^{2}+1)+{e}^{x}}.$\n\n$x$\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}",
